WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.911 --> 00:00:05.321
In this video you'll see the graduate skills you've practiced this school year.

2
00:00:05.822 --> 00:00:09.272
On your home page, select My Graduate Portrait.

3
00:00:09.772 --> 00:00:16.062
Each skill shows whether you've practiced it. When you have, it lists the games and lessons that count.

4
00:00:16.564 --> 00:00:24.714
Some skills say Not practiced yet. That only means you haven't finished an activity for that skill so far. It isn't a grade.

5
00:00:25.222 --> 00:00:32.352
Near the bottom, you can pin up to three things you wrote, like a reflection or a goal. Select Pin my words.

6
00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:37.760
Choose one, pick a skill to show it beside if you like, and select Pin this.

7
00:00:38.261 --> 00:00:44.431
Your pinned words show up on your portrait. Only you see them here, and you can remove one any time.
